@page "/docs/primitives/field"

<DocsPage Title="Field" Description="A component that provides labeling and validation for form controls.">
    <ComponentPreview Name="primitives/field-hero" />
    <DocsHeading Title="Anatomy" />
    <p>Import the primitives and assemble the parts:</p>
    <CodeFigure Code="@Anatomy" />
    <p>
        A field labels and describes its control, and validates it: with the browser's constraint validation (attributes such
        as <code>required</code> and <code>pattern</code>), a <code>Validate</code> function, or both.
        <code>ValidationMode</code> chooses when it validates: on submit, on blur, or on every change. It defaults to the
        <a href="/docs/primitives/form">form</a>'s mode, or to on submit.
        <code>FieldError</code> shows its message while the field is invalid, or only for the constraint its
        <code>Match</code> names.
    </p>
